---
description: Project-wide AI application engineering rules
alwaysApply: true
---

- Use Python 3.12, complete type hints, and public docstrings.
- Keep presentation, application coordination, domain models, and side effects separate.
- Add unit, error-handling, and validation tests for implemented behavior.
- Record changes to accepted architecture in a new or superseding ADR.
- Do not add autonomous or agentic behavior without an approved ADR.
